---
title: Submit assignment (SDD Fig 5) updated for CR1 — applicable-deadline resolution
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor St as Student
  participant UI as Console (main.cpp)
  participant SS as SubmissionService
  participant AZ as AuthorizationService
  participant CR as ICourseRepository
  participant DE as DeadlineEvaluator
  participant SR as ISubmissionRepository
  St->>UI: 9, assignment ID, file path
  UI->>SS: submitFile(session, assignmentId, path)
  SS->>AZ: requireRole(Student)
  SS->>CR: findActiveAssignment(assignmentId)
  SS->>AZ: isStudentEnrolled(student, course)
  SS->>CR: findExtensionDeadline(assignmentId, student)
  SS->>CR: findClassExtensionDeadline(assignmentId)
  Note over SS,CR: new in v1.1
  SS->>DE: applicableDeadline(original, individual, classWide)
  DE-->>SS: latest of the three (BR-11)
  SS->>DE: latenessDays(serverNow, applicable)
  alt resubmission (version > 1) and late
    SS-->>UI: reject: only before the applicable deadline
  else first submission, or on time
    SS->>SR: saveVersion(version with deadline_used, lateness, status)
    Note over SR: snapshot kept, later extensions never rewrite it (CR1-D4)
    SS-->>UI: submission ID
  end
  UI-->>St: Submission file stored and saved
